            ],
            "user id": "sean0to10k",
            "tweet id": "1504532778024685569",
            "content": "i had an agency where i went into sales teams of different companies in the uk and taught them sales i was turning them into real killers on the phone ... and i had to be there physically it 's not something you can easily do over zoom and there was one more thing happening ...",
